steps.raw:
THOUGHT: I have the patient ID and the measured value; I'll create a FHIR Observation resource for the BP vitals and attach it to the patient to record the measurement.

POST http://localhost:8080/fhir/Observation
{
  "resourceType": "Observation",
  "category": [
    {
      "coding": [
        {
          "system": "http://hl7.org/fhir/observation-category",
          "code": "vital-signs",
          "display": "Vital Signs"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "code": {
    "text": "Blood pressure"
  },
  "effectiveDateTime": "2023-11-13T10:15:00Z",
  "status": "final",
  "valueString": "118/77 mmHg",
  "subject": {
    "reference": "Patient/S2380121"
  }
}

